OL,3,GNEWSADangerous driver admits killing
OL,4,Aone and injuring two after car flipped
OL,5,Aover
OL,6,
OL,7,FA driver has admitted killing one
OL,8,Fpassenger and injuring two others when
OL,9,Fhis Mercedes car flipped over and
OL,10,Fcrashed on the motorway near Heathrow
OL,11,FAirport.
OL,13,FAadil Sabir, 31, had been due to face
OL,14,Ftrial at the Old Bailey on Tuesday over
OL,15,Fthe fatal collision at junction three
OL,16,Fof the M4 in west London on 29 October,
OL,17,F2023.
OL,19,FOn Thursday, he pleaded guilty to
OL,20,Fcausing the death of William Bailey by
OL,21,Fdangerous driving and causing serious
OL,22,Finjury to Azfur Khan and Hamad Zaman.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
